# Restore a copied Ari test profile, inspect inventory, save without moving.
# Screenshots plus the newly written compressed arrays are evidence; no VM
# state mutation is performed by this script.
320 key A
420 key A
700 screenshot shots/restored-map.bmp
740 key X
800 screenshot shots/restored-inventory.bmp
840 key ESCAPE
900 screenshot shots/map-after-inventory.bmp
940 key ESCAPE
1000 screenshot shots/save-prompt.bmp
1020 key A
1130 screenshot shots/saved.bmp
1150 key RETURN
